  "prefLabel": "Hum 315.07 Burden and Standard of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hum 315.07 Burden and Standard of Proof. In order to receive a favorable decision the complainant shall have the burden of proving the case for the complaint by a preponderance of the evidence.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hum 300) #8815-A, eff 2-3-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hum100-300.html"
